\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {7}{\ignorespaces Diurnal cycle of small ($L<65$\,km) precipitating systems. (a) truth population cycle vs local solar time, land vs ocean; (b) model POD vs local solar time at several leads, land (solid) vs ocean (dashed). Land detection is phase-locked to the afternoon convective maximum; ocean detection is flat.}}{11}{figure.caption.16}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:diurnal}{{7}{11}{Diurnal cycle of small ($L<65$\,km) precipitating systems. (a) truth population cycle vs local solar time, land vs ocean; (b) model POD vs local solar time at several leads, land (solid) vs ocean (dashed). Land detection is phase-locked to the afternoon convective maximum; ocean detection is flat}{figure.caption.16}{}}
