\newlabel{fig:ablation}{{8}{12}{Input-ablation test. Predicted small-system population cycle vs local solar time (top: land, bottom: ocean) for the baseline and two ablations in which solar-tied inputs are replaced by their daily mean. The land afternoon peak survives all ablations, showing the diurnal cycle is encoded in the model weights}{figure.caption.17}{}}
